{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121543","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121543/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121543/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121543/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121543","id":4921692171,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJVsQCw","number":121543,"title":"Regression: Can no longer change properties of a key object for exported Dictionary in inspector","user":{"login":"Kylemcarthur","id":29736706,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzM2NzA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29736706?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur","html_url":"https://github.com/Kylemcarthur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-07-19T06:56:37Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T15:09:48Z","closed_at":"2026-07-20T15:09:34Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nNot reproducible in v4.6.3.stable.official [7d41c59c4].\n\nIs reproducible in v4.7.1.rc1.official [17e2686e0].\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.1.rc1 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.16.1074) - AMD Ryzen 5 7600X 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 31.61 GiB memory - WASAPI (96000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nOriginally brought this up in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104581, where it was also verified as reproducible, but making a separate issue for it as they recommended.\n\nBefore v4.7, it was possible in the inspector to edit the properties of a key object in an exported dictionary. As of v4.7, this is no longer possible.\n\nHere is a screenshot from v4.6.3.stable.official [7d41c59c4]\n\n<img width=\"856\" height=\"256\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/105a73d7-b82c-4383-8632-527d28cbe421\" />\n\nNow in 4.7.\n\n<img width=\"871\" height=\"137\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b7b584b9-75e0-48ca-a7af-b0acb89ad5b4\" />\n\nUnlike before, these `Trigger` data containers I use as keys can no longer be interacted with in the inspector in any way as far as I can tell. Clicking on them does nothing. I can't edit their properties, I can't view them, I can't save them into a separate asset to edit, nothing. This bricks the functionality I use throughout my project.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Exported a typed Dictionary with an editable object as the keys.\n2. Create an entry in the Dictionary in the inspector.\n3. After adding the entry, see that the key can no longer be expanded to view details, properties edited, etc.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n```\nextends Resource\n\n@export var triggers: Dictionary[Trigger, Action]\n\n```","closed_by":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121543/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,